  "description": "Calculate the total number of friend requests made based on age constraints: age[B] > 0.5 * age[A] + 7, age[B] <= age[A], and age[B] > age[A] (if B is older, A cannot request B).",
  "target": null,
  "pseudocode": "1. ages.sort((a, b) => a - b);\n2. let count = 0, left = 0, right = 0;\n3. for (let age of ages) {\n4.   while (ages[left] <= 0.5 * age + 7) left++;\n5.   while (right < ages.length && ages[right] <= age) right++;\n6.   if (right - 1 > left) count += (right - 1 - left);\n7. }",
